 3484                     ; MUST BE A NUMBER BETWEEN 0 AND 255.
 3485                     ; THE CLOSED PARENTHESIS MUST BE CHECKED AND RETURN IS DIRECTLY
 3486                     ; TO "FRMEVL" WITH THE TEXT PNTR POINTING BEYOND THE ")".
