 6413                     	;WITH PI/2 BY COMPARING THE RESULT OF THE DIVISION
 6414                     	;WITH PI/2/(2*PI)=1/4.
 6415                     	;IDENTITIES ARE THEN USED TO GET THE RESULT IN QUADRANTS
 6416                     	;I OR IV. AN APPROXIMATION POLYNOMIAL IS THEN USED TO
